<title>FINLAND: IMATRAN VOIMA JAN-AUG PROFIT DOUBLES.</title>
<headline>IMATRAN VOIMA JAN-AUG PROFIT DOUBLES.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to end-August, 1996</p>
<p>				     (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items   1,156 vs 573</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)	    8.73 vs 4.57</p>
<p> Net sales				   6,758 vs 5,048</p>
<p> Operating profit			  1,235 vs 725</p>
<p> Depreciation				  556 vs 518</p>
<p> Net financial items		 charge 79 vs 152 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items		   gain 24 vs 12 gain</p>
<p> Net profit				    820 vs 427</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	 45 vs 46</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish state-owned power producer is</p>
<p>Imatran Voima Oy. The government plans a partial privatisation</p>
<p>in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0242</p>
